Subject: [PATCH 16/17] refactor: namespace the packages under src/signal_lab
 (decision 0010)

stats, results and signals are all plausible third-party names; a shadowing
collision would surface as a mysterious import error rather than as a layout
problem. vetoes/ and render/ stay where SUBSTRATE section 15 puts them.
